      Downward LUT6 Compilation in a Mixture of Limits Cascade
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This study reports the public reference at openIE-dev/lut-adapt-ai (commit 560bd86) and hardware synthesis/MCU packages in openIE-dev/openie-research-experiments (aller-a7-xc7a200t/ and lut6-core-nucleus/). Backed by 98 six-kernel-verified Lean 4.36.0 theorems across thirteen modules including NucleusCodon.lean, TernaryTmac.lean, GlobalFrontiers.lean, WearableLastExam.lean, TernaryHadamardArc.lean, BonsaiStreamArc3.lean, ApexHarnessWalls.lean, DeterministicNullWaios.lean, and SerializedIwJouleBit27B.lean plus Inria Charon+Aeneas mechanical #![no_std] Rust-to-Lean extraction (and 1,463 theorems across four OpenIE repositories inside Linux bwrap sandboxes, con-leche and con-ron --verified [58,928 decls], CVE-2026-72844-hardened), it places a reconfigurable 6-input truth-table (LUT6) lookup tier, a 14.77 KB (15,121 B, 14 C-ABI exports) browser-native wasm32 lut6_core.wasm module, a 4 KB / two-bank 8 KB #![no_std] Rust 1.100.0 lut6-core + ISCA 2025 antisymmetric 40-entry zero-MUL EntroMCU/T-MAC + 1.750 bpw (-22.22%, saving 1.564 GB static / 1.490 GiB per streaming sweep on prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B with 1.049 cold Wave-1 / 1.325 warm Wave-2 tok/sweep, 3.935 GiB/tok, and 0.0534 J/tok JpCT via two-rung Token-LUT6 + conformal JouleBit-LUT6 speculation) shift-5 FWHT-1024 ternary Nucleus (0 wasted bytes, fitting in 25.06% of 64 KB SRAM on Nordic nRF52832 Cortex-M4F and RISC-V RV32IMAC MCUs, 12.50% [8,192 B] for two-bank ARC-AGI-3 System-0 vaults, 9.13% [5,984 B] for Wearable-MoL Rung-0 with a 56-bit 4-token smart-glasses opener and hle:3r2s canary quarantine, and 6.25% [4,096 B] for downward-compiled System-0 decisions running 9,493.7× faster than Mapika/decider-0.8b and closing the four late-2026 Frontier AI Walls plus Compiled Agency via OpenIE-Apex-Harness across 16-game official ARC-AGI-3 Landmark-Serialized SIW(2)+Beneš-LUT6 [9/113 levels across 7/16 games, unlocking m0r0 &amp; s5i5, 479.1× Wave-2 RHAE lift to 2.2520, peak 10.7143, 0 collision trips], 7-fabric